WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.954
Reflective practice helps people learn from experience by examining actions, assumptions, evidence, outcomes, and future adjustments.

2
00:00:08.954 --> 00:00:13.052
It is structured, specific, and connected to changed behavior.

3
00:00:13.052 --> 00:00:22.461
Experience supplies the material, but reflection turns that material into better questions, better decisions, better tools, and better habits.

4
00:00:22.461 --> 00:00:26.407
Strong reflection happens before, during, and after action.

5
00:00:26.407 --> 00:00:31.263
Before action, it clarifies goals, assumptions, risks, and expectations.

6
00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:36.044
During action, it helps people notice confusion and changing conditions.

7
00:00:36.044 --> 00:00:40.065
After action, it reviews what happened and what should change.

8
00:00:40.065 --> 00:00:45.984
Together, these moments create a learning loop that supports action instead of delaying it.

9
00:00:45.984 --> 00:00:49.019
Evidence and feedback keep reflection honest.

10
00:00:49.019 --> 00:00:57.442
Facts, artifacts, metrics, peer input, user outcomes, and system behavior help separate what happened from what we think it means.

11
00:00:57.442 --> 00:01:01.464
Calibration improves when confidence is updated by evidence.

12
00:01:01.464 --> 00:01:08.521
Hindsight bias is reduced when people ask what was knowable at the time, not only what seems obvious afterward.

13
00:01:08.521 --> 00:01:11.025
The goal is not endless introspection.

14
00:01:11.025 --> 00:01:17.702
The goal is better judgment, better learning, better systems, and more reliable performance over time.

15
00:01:17.702 --> 00:01:30.830
Reflective practice works best when it produces reusable notes, clearer decisions, stronger routines, improved team processes, and specific adjustments that make the next attempt better than the last.

16
00:01:30.830 --> 00:01:41.150
Used this way, reflection becomes a quiet engineering habit: short enough to sustain, honest enough to matter, and practical enough to change what happens next.
